%% AI Quiz — Madar V1
%% Authority: Descriptive. Source of truth: docs/05-runtime/ai-quiz.md
sequenceDiagram
    actor Student
    participant App as Web/API
    participant AI as Learning & AI
    participant LLM as LLM (external)
    participant DB as Persistence

    Student->>App: finish targeted video, request quiz
    App->>AI: submit generation (idempotent) -> operation-id
    App-->>Student: operation-id (poll for status)
    AI->>LLM: generate from teacher content (via LLM interface)
    alt success
        LLM-->>AI: quiz
        AI->>DB: persist quiz (before answering)
        Student->>App: poll -> Succeeded; answer quiz
        App->>DB: persist answers + auto-score (student-visible)
    else fail / timeout
        AI-->>App: Failed
        App-->>Student: clear failure + retry (NO partial quiz persisted)
    end
